Certainly! You can use the following JavaScript code to reload the current page every 2 minutes (120,000 milliseconds) by pasting it into your browser's console:

```javascript
setInterval(function() {
    location.reload();
}, 120000);
```

This code sets up an interval that calls the `location.reload()` function every 120,000 milliseconds (which is equivalent to 2 minutes).

